# Content, SEO & Research Integrity

- Follow `docs/CONTENT_AND_RESEARCH_STANDARDS.md` and `docs/SITEMAP.md`.
- Distinguish authority vs commentary vs illustrative examples. Label sample data.
- Court cases are a research shortlist until verified — do not publish as verified holdings.
- Educational content is not individualized tax advice.
- Unique titles/descriptions via `generateMetadata`; plan for sitemap/robots at launch readiness.
- Keep form UI separate from future submission adapters (`submitLead` abstraction).
